e is no valid start frame (object visible + NextTo=false). The annotated 4 states are approach -> grasp -> lift -> at_box (L=4, 3 visible transitions). If at_box is not accepted the episode falls back to 3 frames (approach/grasp/lift, L=3). ego judgeability: start/approach/grasp/lift = yes (object visible; seabed contact at grasp and visible gap at lift are readable in ego); at_box = PARTIAL: the green box is clearly visible and its ego area grows markedly from lift to at_box while the robot arm overlays the box rim, but 'at the release position nearby' is a qualitative ego judgement (no metric distance threshold). The near-box relation NearBox(robot, green_box) is therefore marked with ego judgeability=partial; wrist video was NOT used for any label (ego-only labels).",
